  (nan: never a lambda-MAP); tau/mult: tau_n over the mean multiplicity of the sampled error cells; max/mean:
  largest over mean multiplicity; fam@x / p@x: fraction of samples whose lambda-MAP at lambda = x is the true
  parity at any rate / at rate p; right neighbour: family of the hull vertex just right of the family.
