(E) [A m12] t3(A), d = 12, m = 8, |S1| = 16 (j' = 4): envelope F6 against the good model F1(a, 1/16)
  F6 length = 3 + d + g(j') + RC(0) + RC(0) = 3 + 12 + 5 + 1 + 1 = 22; F1 length = 3 + d + RC(1/16) = 3 + 12 + 9 = 24
  beyond the parity: envelope 7 bits (g(j') = 5 and two deterministic flags), good model 9 bits
